#. Tag: para
#: tool-flickrexport.docbook:5
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "FlickrExport Kipi-plugin allows the user to upload photos to the <ulink "
#| "url=\"http://www.flickr.com\">Flickr</ulink> web service."
msgid ""
"FlickrExport tool allows the user to upload photos to the <ulink url="
"\"http://www.flickr.com\">Flickr</ulink> web service."
msgstr ""
"FlickrExport Kipi dodatak omogućuje korisniku prenošenje fotografija na "
"<ulink url=\"http://www.flickr.com\">Flickr</ulink> web usluge."

#. Tag: title
#: tool-flickrexport.docbook:12
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "Flickr Export"
msgid "Flickr Export Tool"
msgstr "Flickr izvoz"

#. Tag: para
#: tool-flickrexport.docbook:14
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Flickr is an online photo management application. Flickr is a way to get "
"your photos to the people who matter to you. With Flickr you can show off "
"your favorite photos to the world, blog the photos you take with a "
"cameraphone, and securely and privately show photos to your friends and "
"family around the world."
msgstr ""
"Flickr je online aplikacija za upravljanje fotografija. Flickr je način "
"pokazivanja slika ljudima do kojih ti je stalo. Sa Flickr mozete pokazati "
"svoje omiljene fotografije svetu, objaviti fotografije koje uslikate "
"telefonom, i bezbdeno i privatno pokazati fotografije prijateljima i "
"familiji u svetu."

#. Tag: para
#: tool-flickrexport.docbook:21
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The FlickrExport plugin can be used to upload an image collection from "
#| "your computer to the remote flickr server using the Internet."
msgid ""
"The FlickrExport tool can be used to upload an image collection from your "
"computer to the remote flickr server using the Internet."
msgstr ""
"FlickrExport  dodatak može se koristiti za prenošenje kolekcija slika sa "
"vašeg računara na udaljene flickr servere korišteći Internet."

#. Tag: title
#: tool-flickrexport.docbook:27
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "Plugin initialization on first access"
msgid "Tool initialization on first access"
msgstr "Inicijalizacije dodataka na prvom pristupu."

#. Tag: para
#: tool-flickrexport.docbook:29
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "When accessing the plugin for the first time the user you are taken "
#| "through the process of obtaining a token which is used for authentication "
#| "purposes. The following dialog will popup and a browser window will be "
#| "launched you will log in to <ulink url=\"http://www.flickr.com\">Flickr</"
#| "ulink>:"
msgid ""
"When accessing the tool for the first time you are taken through the process "
"of obtaining a token which is used for authentication purposes. The "
"following dialog will popup and a browser window will be launched you will "
"log in to <ulink url=\"http://www.flickr.com\">Flickr</ulink>:"
msgstr ""
"Kada pristupate dodatku po prvi put korisnik kojeg uzimate kroz proces "
"dobivanja znaka koji se koristi za autentifikaciju svrhe. Sljedeći dijalog "
"će iskočiti i prozor preglednika će biti pokrenut vi ćete se prijaviti na "
"<ulink url=\"http://www.flickr.com\">Flickr</ulink>:"

#. Tag: title
#: tool-flickrexport.docbook:37
#, no-c-format
msgid "The First Sign Up Dialog Preview"
msgstr "Prikaz prvok znaka Gornjeg Dialoga"

#. Tag: para
#: tool-flickrexport.docbook:43
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After successful signup FlickrUploadr will be allowed to send photos to the "
"flickr website. You will be presented with the following page on successful "
"signup:"
msgstr ""
"Nakon uspješnog prijavljivanja FlickrUploadr će biti omogućiti slanje "
"fotografija na flickr website. Bit će vam predstavljena sljedeća stranica za "
"uspješnu registraciju:"

#. Tag: title
#: tool-flickrexport.docbook:50
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Successful Signup Flickr page"
msgstr "Uspješna registracija Flickr stranice"

#. Tag: para
#: tool-flickrexport.docbook:56
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Then, simply close the browser windows and return to the host application "
"dialog. After clicking <guilabel>Yes</guilabel>, you will see the interface "
"used to upload photos to Flickr, described in the next section."
msgstr ""
"Zatim, jednostavno zatvoriti sve prozore preglednika i vratiti se na dijalog "
"aplikacije domaćina. Nakon klika <guilabel>Yes</guilabel>, vidjet ćete "
"sučelja za upload fotografija na Flickr, opisano u sljedećem odjeljku."

#. Tag: title
#: tool-flickrexport.docbook:65
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "Regular Plugin Usage"
msgid "Regular Tool Usage"
msgstr "Redovne Upotrebe Dodataka"

#. Tag: para
#: tool-flickrexport.docbook:67
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "When the flickrexport plugin is invoked for second time or later you are "
#| "greeted with the following dialog, which shows the current access "
#| "permissions the Flickr Export plugin has. The uploading process requires "
#| "<quote>write</quote> permissions. The plugin doesn't allow any other "
#| "permissions as of now. You are then asked if they want to proceed with "
#| "their current permissions."
msgid ""
"When the flickrexport tool is invoked for second time or later you are "
"greeted with the following dialog, which shows the current access "
"permissions the Flickr Export tool has. The uploading process requires "
"<quote>write</quote> permissions. The tool doesn't allow any other "
"permissions as of now. You are then asked if they want to proceed with their "
"current permissions."
msgstr ""
"Kada je flickrexport dodatak pozvan po drugi put ili kasnije je pozdravljen "
"sa sljedećim dijalogom, koji pokazuje trenutnu dozvolu upotrebe koju "
"FlickrExport ima. Proces prenošenja traži <quote>write</quote> dozvolu. "
"Dodatakne dozvoljava nijednu drugu dozvolu od sad. Kasnije ćete biti pitani "
"da li oni žele da nastave sa njihovim trenutnim dozvolama."

#. Tag: title
#: tool-flickrexport.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid "Current Permissions Dialog preview"
msgstr "Prikaz Dijaloga Trenutnih Dozvola"

#. Tag: para
#: tool-flickrexport.docbook:81
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After clicking <guibutton>Yes</guibutton>, you will see the interface to "
"upload photos to Flickr."
msgstr ""
"Nakon klika <guibutton>Yes</guibutton>, vidjet ćete sučelje prenošenja "
"fotografija na Flickr."

#. Tag: para
#: tool-flickrexport.docbook:85
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After clicking <guibutton>No</guibutton>, the authentication process is "
"repeated."
msgstr "Nakon klika <guibutton>No</guibutton>, proces ovjere se ponavlja."

#. Tag: para
#: tool-flickrexport.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Main upload dialog is shown below:"
msgstr "Glavni dijalog prenošenja je prikazan ispod:"

#. Tag: title
#: tool-flickrexport.docbook:94
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Main Uploading Dialog Preview"
msgstr "Prikaz Glavnog Dijaloga Prenošenja"

#. Tag: para
#: tool-flickrexport.docbook:100
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guibutton>Add Photos</guibutton> button should be clicked once user has "
"set the other options in the dialog. After clicking this button an image "
"selector dialog opens up where you can select the photos you want to upload "
"and click <guibutton>OK</guibutton>, whereupon the image uploading starts."
msgstr ""
"Dugme <guibutton>Add Photos</guibutton> treba kliknuti kad korisnik postavi "
"druge opcije u dijalogu. Nakon klika ovog dugmeta birač slika dijaloga "
"otvara se tamo gdje možete birati fotografije koje želite prenositi i "
"kliknuti <guibutton>OK</guibutton>, kad prenosenje krene."

#. Tag: para
#: tool-flickrexport.docbook:107
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Tags</guilabel> field can be filled with a series of words "
"(comma separated) which will be assigned as tags to the images uploaded."
msgstr ""
"Polje <guilabel>Oznake</guilabel> može biti popunjeno sa serijom riječi "
"(razdvojene tačkom) koje će biti dodijeljene kao oznake prenešenim slikama."

#. Tag: para
#: tool-flickrexport.docbook:112
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Public</guilabel>, <guilabel>Friends</guilabel>, and "
"<guilabel>Family</guilabel> checkboxes can be checked to assign appropriate "
"access permissions to the images you upload. By default the images uploaded "
"are private."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Javno</guilabel>, <guilabel>Prijatelji</guilabel>, i "
"<guilabel>Porodica</guilabel> kvadratići mogu biti označeni da bi im se "
"dodijelile odgovarajuće dozvole za pristup na slikama koje su prenešene. "
"Podrazumijevano slike koje su prenesene su privatne."

#. Tag: para
#: tool-flickrexport.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the <guilabel>Resize photos before uploading</guilabel> option is "
"selected, the photos will be resized before uploading. The values will be "
"read from the <guilabel>Maximum dimension</guilabel> combobox."
msgstr ""
"Ako <guilabel>promijeni slike prije prenošenja </guilabel> opcija je "
"odabrana, fotografija ce biti promijenjena prije prenošenja. Vrijednosti će "
"biti pročitane iz <guilabel>Maximum dimension</guilabel> kombiniranog okvira."

#. Tag: para
#: tool-flickrexport.docbook:124
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Maximum Dimension</guilabel> combobox can be used to adjust "
"the maximum height to which the photos will be resized before uploading. The "
"width calculation will be done so as to have the aspect ratio conserved."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Maksimalna dimenzija</guilabel> kombinirani okvir može se koristit "
"za podešavanje maksimalne visine na koje će se fotografije mijenjati prije "
"prenošenja. Obračun širina će se raditi kako bi imali  sačuvan omjer ekrana."

#. Tag: title
#: tool-flickrexport.docbook:131
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Uploading Progress Dialog Preview"
msgstr "Prikaz Dijaloga Napretka Prenošenja"

#. Tag: para
#: tool-flickrexport.docbook:136
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can click <guilabel>Cancel</guilabel> button to abort the uploading of "
"photos."
msgstr ""
"Možete kliknuti <guilabel>Otkaži</guilabel> dugme da bi prekinuli prenošenje "
"fotografija."

#. Tag: para
#: tool-flickrexport.docbook:140
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Finally, you can view the uploaded photos by visting the <ulink url="
#| "\"http://www.flickr.com\">Flickr</ulink> website."
msgid ""
"Finally, you can view the uploaded photos by visiting the <ulink url="
"\"http://www.flickr.com\">Flickr</ulink> website."
msgstr ""
"Konačno, možete gledati prenosenje fotografija ako posjetite <ulink url="
"\"http://www.flickr.com\">Flickr</ulink> stranicu."

